      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.89483642578125,
        513.403076171875,
        97.246337890625
      ],
      "text": "The two groups are mutually exclusive. Any patient found to have drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.891357421875,
        513.448974609375,
        113.24285888671875
      ],
      "text": "and placed on second-line treatment is removed from the drug-susceptible TB outcome",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.88787841796875,
        510.1713562011719,
        129.2393798828125
      ],
      "text": "cohort. This means that management of the standard TB register and of the second-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.8843994140625,
        513.426025390625,
        145.23590087890625
      ],
      "text": "line TB treatment register needs to be coordinated to ensure proper accounting of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        147.88092041015625,
        201.10888671875,
        161.232421875
      ],
      "text": "outcomes of treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        172.38739013671875,
        513.448974609375,
        185.7388916015625
      ],
      "text": "All bacteriologically confirmed and clinically diagnosed TB cases should be assigned",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        188.3839111328125,
        513.3914794921875,
        201.73541259765625
      ],
      "text": "an outcome from the list in Table A2.1, except those with RR-TB or MDR-TB, who are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        204.38043212890625,
        334.71588134765625,
        217.73193359375
      ],
      "text": "placed on a second-line drug regimen (Table A2.2).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        228.88690185546875,
        513.4144287109375,
        242.2384033203125
      ],
      "text": "Patients found to have an RR-TB or MDR-TB strain at any point in time should be started",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        244.8834228515625,
        513.4834594726562,
        258.23492431640625
      ],
      "text": "on an adequate second-line drug regimen. These cases are excluded from the main TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        260.87994384765625,
        513.3799438476562,
        274.2314453125
      ],
      "text": "cohort when calculating treatment outcomes and included only in the second-line TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        276.87646484375,
        513.41455078125,
        290.22796630859375
      ],
      "text": "treatment cohort analysis (Table A2.2). If treatment with a second-line drug regimen is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        292.87298583984375,
        513.4490356445312,
        306.2244873046875
      ],
      "text": "not possible, the patient is kept in the main TB cohort and assigned an outcome from",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        308.8695068359375,
        219.89988708496094,
        322.22100830078125
      ],
      "text": "among those in Table A2.1.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141.04339599609375,
        345.4631042480469,
        505.5913391113281,
        359.68310546875
      ],
      "text": "Treatment outcomes for TB patients (excluding patients treated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
